Additional safeguard: checkpoint_shutdown() explicitly fsyncs WAL before checkpointing (pager.rs lines 4159-4161):
```rust
// fsync the wal syncronously before beginning checkpoint
let c = wal.sync(self.get_sync_type())?;
self.io.wait_for_completion(c)?;
```
This ensures that even for shutdown checkpoints, all WAL frames are durable before backfilling to DB.
